# Sol Ring: "{T}: Add {C}{C}" - two colorless mana and no color: red, green and the rest are refused beside colorless (the positive
# control). Colorless mana cannot pay for a colored symbol (CR 106.1b, 118.1), so with only the Ring's {C}{C} (the Mountain
# is tapped for the Ring) a Lightning Bolt is not castable - the cast is refused - while the same two mana pay for a Mind
# Stone ({2}), the positive control.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Sol Ring
Lightning Bolt
Mind Stone
Mountain x3
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
! Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate(Color: Red)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate(Color: Green)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {C}{C}
! Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2; Mana: short)
Bot1.Hand.Mind Stone.Cast

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield = Mountain; Sol Ring; Mind Stone
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Tapped = true
